msgid ""
":doc:`Attribute-Based Access Control (ABAC) </administration-"
"guide/manage/admin/attribute-based-access-control>` must be enabled by a "
"System Admin in **System Console > System Attributes > Attribute-Based "
"Access**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/admin/abac-channel-access-rules.rst:22
msgid ""
"You need Channel Admin permissions and the "
"``manage_channel_access_rules`` permission."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/admin/abac-channel-access-rules.rst:23
msgid "Channel access rules are available only for private channels."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/admin/abac-channel-access-rules.rst:26
msgid "Access Channel Settings"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/admin/abac-channel-access-rules.rst:28
msgid ""
"In a private channel where you have Channel Admin permissions, select the"
" channel name at the top of the center pane."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/admin/abac-channel-access-rules.rst:29
msgid "Select **Channel Settings** from the dropdown menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/admin/abac-channel-access-rules.rst:30
msgid ""
"Navigate to the **Access Control** tab. This tab is only visible for "
"private channels when you have the appropriate permissions and ABAC is "
"enabled system-wide."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/admin/abac-channel-access-rules.rst:34
msgid ""
"You can also assign ABAC rules to a channel directly from a channel's "
"details page in the System Console under **Channel Management** by "
"enabling the **Enable attribute-based channel access** option. Under "
"**Access policy**, select **Link to a policy** to select an existing "
"policy."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/admin/abac-channel-access-rules.rst:37
msgid "Configure access rules"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/admin/abac-channel-access-rules.rst:39
msgid ""
"Channel access rules use the same simple interface as system policies, "
"allowing you to create attribute-based conditions without complex syntax."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/admin/abac-channel-access-rules.rst:41
msgid ""
"In the **Access Control** tab, you'll see any inherited system policies "
"at the top in a blue information banner (if applicable)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/admin/abac-channel-access-rules.rst:42
msgid "Use the **Add attribute** button to create new access conditions:"
